  "header": {
    "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "bt-range",
    "description": "What: destructible buildings (CE-4391 S-5), three acts on bt-range, staggered. (a) 'Charge Man' walks to House A's west wall (x = 100) and sets off his 8 kg demolition charge: a PASSAGE in the wall (the front, back and hall doors are Locked, so the west room is sealed); the squad 'Breach 1' / 'Breach 2' waits 14 s, then walks in to (103, 104) through the gap, which the navmesh follows after the bake. (b) 'Tank' (M1, 192, 106) engages 'Decoy' standing against House B's east wall: its HE-FRAG round bursts at the wall and makes a HOLE; 'Observer' (178, 106) then has a line of sight to 'Inside Man' behind the wall. (c) An A-10 drops one Mk-82 on the CQB House (40..54, 100..110): the building collapses to rubble and 'Occupant' inside dies. Judge: see checks.json (the three outcomes). Not expressible in the checks grammar: see docs/DESIGN_Scenario_Regression.md section 9 (a breach or a collapse cue)."
  },
